    "progressNames": [
      {
        "role": "StaticText",
        "name": "Progress"
      },
      {
        "role": "StaticText",
        "name": "Displays an indicator showing the completion progress of a task, typically displayed as a progress bar."
      },
      {
        "role": "StaticText",
        "name": "Use ProgressLabel and ProgressValue to add a label and value display."
      },
      {
        "role": "StaticText",
        "name": "Kotlin uses a fraction by default: Progress(0.6f) is 60%. The official recipes pass max = 100f explicitly. Use indeterminate = true for unknown progress; ProgressValue then omits the percentage. Compose exposes a normalized progress range and hides the duplicate value text. Native HTML naming, min/null/format/render props and screen-reader behavior are not equivalent APIs."
      },
      {
